{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1306247-v5-vampire-5th-edition-homebrew-wiki","id":1306247,"title":"[V5] Vampire 5th Edition Homebrew Wiki","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-04-20T07:28:02-07:00","id":1306247,"title":"[V5] Vampire 5th Edition Homebrew Wiki","content":"This project has been in development for a couple of months. It took me a little longer than I had expected to put together all the templates that could cover all of the potential options needed.<br /> <br /> The Vampire the Masquerade 5th Edition Homebrew Wiki is now **LIVE** and in an Open Beta. The wiki is meant to be a repository for homebrew material including Discipline powers, entire new Disciplines, Clan and Bloodline conversions, new Clans and Bloodlines, Advantages, Predator Types, Special Rules or articles, and SPCs. The wiki makes extensive use of templates to make it easy for even those who are not wiki-savvy to submit their material to the wiki.<br /> <br /> The wiki is open currently to create accounts to post your own material or comment on material that has been submitted. At this time, there are no plans to make this a 'curated' wiki (that is, vet the material that is submitted') other than to fix things that break templates or don't get submitted via templates or do maintenance for questionable content or active wiki vandalism. If you want to contribute but are not comfortable with the wiki stuff, there is an email address in the guidelines and details on what to do so the staff can add your material, as well.<br /> <br /> The wiki can be found at <a href=\"https://www.v5homebrew.com/\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.v5homebrew.com/</a><br /> <br /> You can email the wiki administration at v5homebrew at gmail dot com with questions and comments, or find me on the WoD5 Discord as well.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1808-elmerg","name":"elmerg","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"539"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-26T05:53:38-07:00","id":1461548,"title":"","content":"WISE FWOM YOUW GWAVE!!!!!<br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">We have performed a significant update to the wiki, and now it can directly integrate Google Drive and Google Docs files, as well as direct PDF uploads and the normal wiki syntax.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">With that said, we've been integrating files from a compiled Google Drive of homebrew materials (that have been shared with us for distribution), ranging from Loresheets, Disciplines and Predator Types to full game line conversions of things like Changeling and Immortals! We have tons of stuff (140+ articles) and we aren't even done integrating everything yet.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">I'm throwing this out here as I know the Wiki has come up in a number of discussions before, and wanted to just give a general status update.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Come check us out at <a href=\"https://www.v5homebrew.com/\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.v5homebrew.com/</a></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">I'd also be happy to answer any questions you might have about the wiki.</span></span></span><br />","signature":"","edit